type: software
title: "Thermal Queue Governor: clipped sensing and delayed motor commands"
authors:
  - name: SrinivasNampalli
repository-code: "https://github.com/SrinivasNampalli/thermal-queue-governor"
url: "https://srinivasnampalli.github.io/thermal-queue-governor/"
version: 0.2.0
abstract: >-
  AI-assisted synthetic research and interactive software for a scalar interval
  motor thermal governor with clipped observations and an accepted-command FIFO.
  Results are conditional on the stated model and actuator assumptions.
  No hardware validation or patent filing is claimed. Original materials remain
  rights reserved pending review; third-party dependencies retain their licenses.
keywords:
  - thermal control
  - interval estimation
  - motor control
  - clipped sensors
  - command governor
